<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-103-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.437525" lon="-120.91335"><name>SC26-103-C</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 2.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 27/100; not catch probability. Center 41 ft; nearby 37–47 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. Parts of the investigation circle are shallower than 40 ft. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-083</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43984882502788" lon="-120.91477726965526"/><trkpt lat="35.43921045901782" lon="-120.9143531183659"/><trkpt lat="35.438763724479344" lon="-120.91458495383687"/><trkpt lat="35.439049265489" lon="-120.91545882464841"/><trkpt lat="35.43949600182438" lon="-120.91522699302351"/><trkpt lat="35.43931958953629" lon="-120.91545185323726"/><trkpt lat="35.439415402381904" lon="-120.91577984795485"/><trkpt lat="35.43897626897693" lon="-120.91645209882198"/><trkpt lat="35.439072079101" lon="-120.91678009349161"/><trkpt lat="35.438525728577986" lon="-120.91646371206909"/><trkpt lat="35.438349313773536" lon="-120.91668856689175"/><trkpt lat="35.438535231302225" lon="-120.91701423736154"/><trkpt lat="35.43817669904939" lon="-120.91713362992256"/><trkpt lat="35.43807328732769" lon="-120.91636522064357"/><trkpt lat="35.43833980960745" lon="-120.91613804297917"/><trkpt lat="35.43824209642575" lon="-120.9156999474902"/><